added ids, only for room conversations, only when room rules pass under lock and no revocation exists, else the whole 
UPDATE fails (MEMBERSHIP_GRANT_FORBIDDEN / MEMBERSHIP_REVOKED / ROOM_ACCESS_DENIED); EXECUTE revoked from 
public/anon/authenticated.
182-  7. Join route and resolver → new service_role RPC `public.join_room_conversation(uuid,uuid)` (lock order users 
FOR SHARE by id → space FOR SHARE → conversation FOR NO KEY UPDATE; decides by the membership row; current member 
