260-- New `POST /api/messages/metrics`: body `{ events: MessagingMetricEventInput[] }`, each `{ type, reason?, 
conversationType?, durationMs?, count?, occurredAt? }`. Order: auth via `requireAuthUser` (401, nothing charged, no 
metric line) → per-user fail-closed budget 'messaging:metrics' 30/60 s charged on every authenticated request (429 on 
limit, limiter failure, or limiter client construction failure) → 415 non-JSON → 413 METRICS_PAYLOAD_TOO_LARGE for raw 
bodies > 16384 bytes counted on bytes received (declared oversize refused before reading; chunked/understated cut 
while streaming, stream cancelled) → 400 invalid UTF-8/JSON/shape → 413 METRICS_BATCH_TOO_LARGE for > 50 events → 202 
`{accepted, dropped}`; unexpected errors 500 with the error name only. Rejected requests write no metric line (normal 
