 393: --   comment on function public.create_message_attempt(uuid, uuid, text, text, uuid, uuid, bigint, jsonb, 
uuid[]) is
 394: --     'Phase 5 T2: creates a keyed text message, or a message with 1-5 pending uploads of its sender (Phase 4 
T12/T15 rules), committing only when the attempt generation is current for (sender, conversation, key) at commit time 
(a generation-less keyed create only when no fence state exists). Returns {message_id, created, composition}; 
created=false is a replay. Raises ATTEMPT_SUPERSEDED when fenced and MESSAGE_DELETED when a generation-carrying create 
would recreate a deleted message. Service role only; callers authorize the sender and validate the attachment policy 
first.';
